@host = http://127.0.0.1:5000

# Run Features/LookupLifecycle/LookupLifecycle.http first to capture fixture IDs.
# Its final state leaves fixtures deleted. Restore before testing another successful delete.

### DeleteBreed
POST {{host}}/breed/{{lookupBreedId}}/deletion
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "reason": 4
}

### Malformed GUID - expected 400
POST {{host}}/breed/not-a-guid/deletion
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "reason": 4
}

### Empty GUID - expected 400
POST {{host}}/breed/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/deletion
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "reason": 4
}

### Missing target - expected 404 if this ID is absent
POST {{host}}/breed/ffffffff-ffff-4fff-8fff-ffffffffffff/deletion
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "reason": 4
}
